/* Lh016 — Edition-3 extra header entities (FILE_INFO, FILE_POPULATION,
 *         SECTION_LANGUAGE, ...)
 * Defect (under strict Edition-2 readers): file's HEADER includes
 * Edition-3-only additional entities (FILE_POPULATION,
 * SECTION_LANGUAGE, FILE_INFO). Edition-2 readers either fail to
 * parse or reject any header entity beyond the canonical three;
 * Edition-3 readers must accept them. The implementation_level is
 * '3;1' to additionally signal Edition-3 conformance. */
ISO-10303-21;
